.TH ARCO-MAKE-LATEX 1 "September 2026" "arco-authors" "ARCO authors tools"
.SH NAME
arco-make-latex \- build a LaTeX document using the ARCO make rules
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B arco-make-latex
.RB [ all | clean | vclean |
.IR pdf-file ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B arco-make-latex
runs
.BR make (1)
with
.I /usr/include/arco/latex.mk
on the given target in the current directory.
.SH TARGETS
.TP
.B all
Build the document.
.TP
.B clean
Remove intermediate files.
.TP
.B vclean
Remove intermediate and generated files.
.TP
.I pdf-file
Build that PDF file from its LaTeX source.
.SH FILES
.I /usr/include/arco/latex.mk
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR make (1),
.BR pdflatex (1)
